# gRPC host

Read listener settings from the deployment configuration. Register the application handlers and map the service implementation in the host. When the platform provides a host extension, supply the same settings through that extension.

This template shows the composition root for a service whose HTTP/2 endpoint and TLS settings are configured under `Kestrel:Endpoints`. Substitute the application registration and the generated-base implementation for your service.

```csharp
var builder = WebApplication.CreateBuilder(args);
builder.Services.AddGrpc();
builder.Services.AddApplication();

var app = builder.Build();
app.MapGrpcService<CatalogEndpoint>();
await app.RunAsync();
```
